{"4759420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Brick Mayhem", "steam_appid": 4759420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brick Mayhem is a chaotic physics-based autobattler where tiny plastic warriors clash in spectacular battles and reduce entire fortresses to rubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your minifigs, assemble your army, and watch as explosions blast through walls, towers collapse, and bricks fly across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is packed with unpredictable physics, over-the-top destruction, and armies of fearless little warriors fighting for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physics-based autobattler gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully destructible brick fortresses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explosive siege battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customizable minifigs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Large-scale army clashes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Stylized plastic-inspired visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Lighthearted and humorous atmosphere</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brick Mayhem is a chaotic physics-based autobattler where tiny plastic warriors clash in spectacular battles and reduce entire fortresses to rubble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your minifigs, assemble your army, and watch as explosions blast through walls, towers collapse, and bricks fly across the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle is packed with unpredictable physics, over-the-top destruction, and armies of fearless little warriors fighting for glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Physics-based autobattler gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Fully destructible brick fortresses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Explosive siege battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Customizable minifigs</p><p class=\"